{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887/events","html_url":"https://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887","id":820607184,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU4MjA2MDcxODQ=","number":2887,"title":"Set empty query params should only reset the params portion, not the entire URL","user":{"login":"hieunguyen88","id":15841377,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODQxMzc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15841377?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88","html_url":"https://github.com/hieunguyen88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hieunguyen88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1516285324,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTE2Mjg1MzI0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/labels/type:bug","name":"type:bug","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working as expected"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2021-03-03T03:08:39Z","updated_at":"2021-03-29T22:56:10Z","closed_at":"2021-03-29T22:56:10Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Summary\r\n\r\nWhen set an empty params to experimental_set_query_params(), the URL is set to the base URL.\r\n\r\nSample url: link.com/subfolder/?st_params=foo\r\n\r\nActual result: link.com\r\n\r\nExpected result: link.com/subfolder/\r\n\r\n### Snippet Code\r\n```\r\nimport streamlit as st\r\n\r\nparams = {}\r\nst.experimental_set_query_params(**params)\r\n```\r\nI'm not sure how to run a streamlit app with a link with a sub directory though.\r\n\r\n`streamlit run my_code.py`will open a web page at \"http://localhost:8501\"\r\n\r\n### Is this a regression?\r\nI don't know\r\n\r\n### Debug info\r\n\r\n- Streamlit version: 0.72.0\r\n- Python version: 3.6.9\r\n- OS version: Linux\r\n- Browser version: Chrome\r\n\r\n### Additional information\r\nIt looks like an additional check is needed here when updating the URL:\r\nhttps://github.com/streamlit/streamlit/blob/433d216fbd6bd87f36753789a92b008aafacbc75/frontend/src/App.tsx#L379\r\n\r\nCurrently, when the query_param is empty, it's used '/', which will reset the URL.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"vdonato","id":3144420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDQ0MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3144420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato","html_url":"https://github.com/vdonato","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdonato/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2887/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}